# Without this, `COPY services/api services/api` copies the HOST's
# node_modules over the ones pnpm installed inside the image. On a Windows
# host those are Windows-native binaries, and the container would fail at
# runtime on the first native module. The build context would also be several
# hundred megabytes of files the image never needs.

node_modules
**/node_modules

# Built on the host, rebuilt in the image. Copying a Windows-built dist over a
# Linux build is the same class of mistake as the node_modules one.
dist
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage

.git
.github

# Never build a secret into an image layer.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Flutter and admin are not part of the API image.
apps/rider
apps/driver
packages

*.log
.vscode
.idea
